{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"1f013f6426b27f8cb555c22229b6c039f0c3bf25e128f377b49ae37cdbaeeacb","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira reconcile bridge outbound comment sync","key_entities":["REB-1861","comment_ids","RECONCILER_MARKER","adf_to_text","_normalize_comment_body","_TRUNCATION_SUFFIX","outbound_comments","adapters/jira/comment_limits.py","reconcile-bridge workflow","run 32403944666","accountId 712020:6471376f-4e5e-4ed2-8c05-330827bc387e"],"problem_keywords":["duplicate comments","jira data cleanup","reconcile bridge defect","bot-authored echo","comment deduplication","outbound sync bug"],"propositions":["The reconcile-bridge outbound comment sync reposted identical comments on every hourly pass due to an inert PRIMARY id-identity dedup map (comment_ids empty), accumulating 30,847 duplicate bot-authored comments across 30 Jira issues over multiple passes.","REB-1861 reached Jira's hard 5000-comment cap and is blocked from receiving new comments (COMMENTS_PER_ISSUE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED); 29,931 duplicates across 27 issues required irreversible deletion to restore capacity.","Phase 1 cleanup identified deletion candidates by pre-strip rendered ADF text containing RECONCILER_MARKER, deduplicated by normalized body hash, kept oldest-per-distinct-body, and executed 29,931 safe deletions (REB-1861: 5000→79) with full pre-deletion backup, dry-run verification, canary validation, rate-limit handling, and post-deletion independent verification showing zero missing distinct bodies.","Phase 2 (836 truncation-suffix comments across REB-1567/REB-1931/REB-2605) was deliberately left unexecuted pending operator decision; these comments lack the marker due to outbound truncation at 32767 chars cutting off the trailing marker paragraph, defeating loop-breaker detection."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787401774740641001,"uuid":"36ace90a-2877-40c6-b4fd-ac1bebdf9be2"}